  "messages": [
    {"id": "h01", "text": "Welcome to Field Training, Commander. First the camera. Scroll with the arrow keys or by pushing the mouse to the screen edge, rotate with Q and E, zoom with the mouse wheel. Home returns to your Headquarters.", "speaker": "Field Instructor", "announcer": "match_start_napc"},
    {"id": "h02", "text": "Selecting and moving. Click one of your three Guardian Tanks or drag a box around all of them (Shift adds or removes a unit). Then right-click the spot the camera has jumped to.", "speaker": "Field Instructor"},
    {"id": "h03", "text": "Hostile practice squads ahead. Press A and click near them: attack-move fights everything on the way, while a plain right-click move ignores enemies. Destroy both squads.", "speaker": "Field Instructor"},
    {"id": "h04", "text": "Three more orders. S stops your units, X scatters them (handy against area attacks), H holds position so they only fire from where they stand. Try each one now.", "speaker": "Field Instructor"},
    {"id": "h05", "text": "That lone Watchtower is a practice target. Units never attack neutral buildings on their own. Hold Ctrl (Option on macOS) and right-click it, or press Y and click, to force fire. Destroy it.", "speaker": "Field Instructor"},
    {"id": "h06", "text": "Time to build. Open the Structures tab in the sidebar, click the Generator card, and when it is ready click it again and place it inside the ring around your Headquarters (8 cells). Generators supply the power every building needs.", "speaker": "Field Instructor"},
    {"id": "h07", "text": "Refineries turn deposits into credits. Build one close to the ore field the camera shows. It comes with a free Collector that starts working at once.", "speaker": "Field Instructor"},
    {"id": "h08", "text": "Watch the Collector: it drives to the deposit, fills up with 600 credits, and returns to unload. C selects the next Collector. More Collectors means more income; the credits and income per minute are in the sidebar.", "speaker": "Field Instructor"},
    {"id": "h09", "text": "Infantry come from the Barracks. Build one (500 credits) and place it inside the ring.", "speaker": "Field Instructor"},
    {"id": "h10", "text": "Train two Rifle Squads: open the Infantry tab and click the Rifle Squad card. Left click queues one, right click removes one. Keep an eye on the power bar: a shortage slows production.", "speaker": "Field Instructor"},
    {"id": "h11", "text": "Vehicles need a War Factory (2000 credits). Build and place it. Funds are tight, so wait for the Collector if you have to; the Instructor will top you up if you run dry.", "speaker": "Field Instructor"},
    {"id": "h12", "text": "Queue two more Guardian Tanks in the Vehicles tab. Tanks are your main line, and the Factory's service apron slowly repairs idle ones nearby.", "speaker": "Field Instructor"},
    {"id": "h13", "text": "Rally points. Select the Factory, press F, then click the ground at the spot the camera shows. New vehicles drive there by themselves. Queue one more tank to try it.", "speaker": "Field Instructor"},
    {"id": "h14", "text": "Control groups. Select some tanks and press Ctrl+1 to store them, then 1 to recall them; pressing the number twice centres the camera on the group. Ctrl+A selects every combat unit.", "speaker": "Field Instructor"},
    {"id": "h15", "text": "Base defence and placement. Build an Anti-Tank Turret (800) inside the ring on the western side, where the camera shows. A green ghost means a valid spot, red means blocked. Structures can only be placed within 8 cells of a Headquarters.", "speaker": "Field Instructor"},
    {"id": "h16", "text": "Tech tiers. Build a Radar (1500). It unlocks tier 2 units (Combat Medic, Sentinel AA, Paladin Howitzer), shows the minimap and powers your support powers. Keep the power bar green.", "speaker": "Field Instructor"},
    {"id": "h17", "text": "Support powers. With a powered Radar you can call a UAV Sweep (500 credits). Press F5 and click the map to reveal and detect in an area.", "speaker": "Field Instructor"},
    {"id": "h18", "text": "Alert! A raiding party is coming from the north. Alerts appear as toasts and as pings on the minimap, and Space jumps the camera to the last one. Click the minimap to look, then defend the base.", "speaker": "Field Instructor", "announcer": "base_under_attack"},
    {"id": "h19", "text": "Repairing and selling. R then click a damaged structure repairs it for credits, Delete then click sells a structure for half its price. Sell the old Watchtower beside your Headquarters now.", "speaker": "Field Instructor"},
    {"id": "h20", "text": "Final exercise: two raiding parties are coming, one after the other. Use everything you learned: attack-move, the turret, repairs, rally points, groups. Watch the minimap.", "speaker": "Field Instructor", "announcer": "base_under_attack"},
    {"id": "h21", "text": "Superweapon drill. The rival array in the far corner is charged or charging. When it fires you hear the warning and the minimap shows a ring for several seconds: move your units out of it. Or send tanks to destroy the array first. Either one finishes the drill.", "speaker": "Field Instructor"},
    {"id": "m_alert_sw", "text": "Launch detected! In a real match you would now drag your units out of the ring. This one is an EMP: it only disables vehicles and powered buildings for a few seconds.", "speaker": "Field Instructor", "announcer": "sw_launch_detected"},
    {"id": "m_rival", "text": "Scouts report an unknown array being raised in the far corner of the map and powering up. Remember it: we will come back to it at the end of the course.", "speaker": "Field Instructor", "announcer": "enemy_sw_charging"},
    {"id": "m_w3", "text": "Second wave from the north! Keep your tanks together and fight near the turret.", "speaker": "Field Instructor"},
    {"id": "m_funds", "text": "Command has wired you a funding advance. Spend it wisely.", "speaker": "Field Instructor"},
    {"id": "m_help", "text": "Command has lent a hand so you can move on.", "speaker": "Field Instructor"},
    {"id": "m_done", "text": "Course complete. You can command a base, an economy and an army, and you know how to read an alert. Report to your first corridor, Commander.", "speaker": "Field Instructor", "announcer": "victory"},
    {"id": "m_lost", "text": "Your Headquarters has fallen. Training is over for today. Try the course again.", "speaker": "Field Instructor", "announcer": "defeat"}
  ],
  "objectives": [
    {"id": "s01", "kind": "primary", "text": "Look around: scroll, rotate and zoom the camera", "initial": "hidden"},
    {"id": "s02", "kind": "primary", "text": "Select your tanks and move them to the marked spot", "initial": "hidden"},
    {"id": "s03", "kind": "primary", "text": "Attack-move: destroy the two practice squads", "initial": "hidden"},
    {"id": "s04", "kind": "primary", "text": "Try the stop, scatter and hold orders", "initial": "hidden"},
    {"id": "s05", "kind": "primary", "text": "Force fire: destroy the practice Watchtower", "initial": "hidden"},
    {"id": "s06", "kind": "primary", "text": "Build a Generator", "initial": "hidden"},
    {"id": "s07", "kind": "primary", "text": "Build a Refinery near the ore field", "initial": "hidden"},
    {"id": "s08", "kind": "primary", "text": "Watch the Collector harvest", "initial": "hidden"},
    {"id": "s09", "kind": "primary", "text": "Build a Barracks", "initial": "hidden"},
    {"id": "s10", "kind": "primary", "text": "Train two Rifle Squads", "initial": "hidden"},
    {"id": "s11", "kind": "primary", "text": "Build a War Factory", "initial": "hidden"},
    {"id": "s12", "kind": "primary", "text": "Train two more Guardian Tanks", "initial": "hidden"},
    {"id": "s13", "kind": "primary", "text": "Set a rally point at the marked spot", "initial": "hidden"},
    {"id": "s14", "kind": "primary", "text": "Try control groups (Ctrl+1, then 1)", "initial": "hidden"},
    {"id": "s15", "kind": "primary", "text": "Build an Anti-Tank Turret at the marked spot", "initial": "hidden"},
    {"id": "s16", "kind": "primary", "text": "Build a Radar (tier 2 tech)", "initial": "hidden"},
    {"id": "s17", "kind": "primary", "text": "Use the UAV Sweep support power", "initial": "hidden"},
    {"id": "s18", "kind": "primary", "text": "Defend the base against the raiding party", "initial": "hidden"},
    {"id": "s19", "kind": "primary", "text": "Sell the old Watchtower", "initial": "hidden"},
    {"id": "s20", "kind": "primary", "text": "Final exercise: defeat both raiding parties", "initial": "hidden"},
    {"id": "s21", "kind": "primary", "text": "Superweapon drill: survive the rival's launch or destroy the array", "initial": "hidden"},
    {"id": "keep_hq", "kind": "secondary", "text": "Keep your Headquarters alive"}
  ],
